  "details": "Allow world creators, group owners, and avatar creators to enable a feedback system for their creations on which users can input feedback for further improvement.\n\nFor example:\n\nSomeone publishes a very beautiful house but then they make it totally glitchy on quest or maybe something can be improved, this could be an easy way to provide feedback, if you ever tried to use Google forms to get feedback from your users you will see that some of them will avoid using it due to the possibility of having their personal email leaked or looked at, providing an official way for creators to have feedback is an important feature for continuous improvement.",
